title: "Simple symmetric Venn diagrams with 17 and 19 curves"
authors:
  - family-names: Dzoba
    given-names: Chris
date-released: 2026-09-22
version: "1.2"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dzoba/venn17"
url: "https://github.com/dzoba/venn17"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Venn diagram
  - symmetric
  - combinatorics
  - certificate
abstract: >-
  Simple, rotationally symmetric Venn diagrams with 17 curves and with 19 curves, the
  smallest open cases since the 11- and 13-curve diagrams of Mamakani and Ruskey (2014),
  given as machine-checkable certificates, one of each size verified in Lean 4, together with a standalone checker, the search
  program that found them, a plotter and the write-up. Also includes the first
  non-monotone simple symmetric Venn diagrams with 11 and 13 curves.
